# Cloudflare Pages custom headers -- https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Advertises the MCP server on every response, per the discoverability
# pattern documented at https://specification.website/mcp/.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security and the clickjacking headers below are the two
# required items from specification.website/spec/security/ that Cloudflare
# Pages does not set by default (unlike X-Content-Type-Options and
# Referrer-Policy, which it already adds automatically).
/*
  Link: <https://12getajob.com/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json>; rel="mcp"
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
